diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 6e21b55..5d87a87 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,5 +1,14 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## 0.12.0-source-traceability-private
+
+- Added machine-readable source-use markers to the on-device AI prompt contract.
+- The app now attaches only the verified JW.org or Watchtower Online Library sources the answer actually used instead of every retrieved page.
+- Invalid, uncited, out-of-range, or model-created source output fails closed and falls back to deterministic verified-source guidance.
+- AI citation cards now route through the exact JW Library resolver; the app no longer launches citation URLs directly in a browser.
+- Added unit coverage for used-source selection, duplicate markers, missing markers, invalid source IDs, safe insufficient-source responses, and guided-source fallback markers.
+- Bumped the paired phone and Wear OS private-alpha builds to 0.12.0.
+
 ## 0.9.6-verified-preparation-private
 
 - Removed the manual plus/minus preparation counter and made progress a read-only total derived from completed task records.
